  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Border Security through Improving Border Management Information Systems in Target Countries Worldwide</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to the implementation of the United Nations Security Council Resolutions 2178, 2396 and 2482 in selected beneficiary countries by further enhancing and expanding the IOM-developed border management information system MIDAS.</narrative>
  </description>
